<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Por qué Zur me gusta</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --red: #d60f2f;
      --deep-red: #7a0618;
      --wine: #2a050c;
      --cream: #fff4e6;
      --gold: #f6b84b;
      --soft-gold: #ffe0a3;
      --pink: #ffb7c5;
      --ink: #21050b;
      --glass: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.72);
      --border: rgba(255, 224, 163, 0.35);
      --shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(71, 0, 18, 0.35);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--cream);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.24), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(255, 183, 197, 0.20), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(214, 15, 47, 0.28), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #1b0208 0%, #4c0615 42%, #160105 100%);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 42px 42px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.95), transparent);
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .noise {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.18;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 250 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)' opacity='0.55'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }

    .floating-shapes {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .shape {
      position: absolute;
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 44% 56% 58% 42% / 45% 48% 52% 55%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.22), rgba(214, 15, 47, 0.12));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 224, 163, 0.25);
      filter: blur(0.2px);
      animation: float 12s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .shape.one {
      top: 12%;
      left: -50px;
    }

    .shape.two {
      top: 48%;
      right: -70px;
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      animation-delay: -4s;
    }

    .shape.three {
      bottom: 8%;
      left: 10%;
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      animation-delay: -7s;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translate3d(18px, -26px, 0) rotate(10deg);
      }
    }

    .page {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 4;
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100svh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 72px 0 48px;
    }

    .hero-card {
      position: relative;
      width: min(960px, 100%);
      padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 72px);
      border-radius: 38px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.16), rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.05)),
        rgba(42, 5, 12, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .hero-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 360px;
      height: 360px;
      right: -130px;
      top: -120px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.42), transparent 62%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 224, 163, 0.34);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.08);
      color: var(--soft-gold);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .spark {
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--gold);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 24px 0 18px;
      max-width: 820px;
      font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 9.6rem);
      line-height: 0.84;
      letter-spacing: -0.07em;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .hero-title-accent {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-style: italic;
      text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.26);
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 690px;
      color: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.82);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.18rem);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform 220ms ease, background 220ms ease, border 220ms ease;
    }

    .button.primary {
      color: var(--wine);
      background: var(--gold);
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.2);
    }

    .button.secondary {
      color: var(--cream);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.22);
      background: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.06);
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .golden-monkey {
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(16px, 4vw, 54px);
      bottom: clamp(12px, 4vw, 42px);
      width: clamp(110px, 22vw, 220px);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .monkey-face {
      position: relative;
      width: 72%;
      height: 72%;
      border-radius: 50% 50% 44% 44%;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f8c45e, #c56c16);
      box-shadow: inset -18px -18px 34px rgba(107, 47, 5, 0.22), 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    .monkey-face::before,
    .monkey-face::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 38%;
      height: 42%;
      top: 26%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffe0a3;
    }

    .monkey-face::before {
      left: 11%;
    }

    .monkey-face::after {
      right: 11%;
    }

    .ear {
      position: absolute;
      width: 34%;
      height: 34%;
      top: 30%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e58c24, #9b4b12);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .ear.left {
      left: -18%;
    }

    .ear.right {
      right: -18%;
    }

    .eye {
      position: absolute;
      top: 45%;
      width: 9%;
      height: 9%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--wine);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .eye.left {
      left: 35%;
    }

    .eye.right {
      right: 35%;
    }

    .nose {
      position: absolute;
      width: 14%;
      height: 9%;
      left: 43%;
      top: 58%;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(42, 5, 12, 0.75);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .timeline-wrap {
      position: relative;
      padding: 32px 0 80px;
    }

    .section-label {
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      color: var(--soft-gold);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 18px;
      top: 6px;
      bottom: 6px;
      width: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.7), rgba(214, 15, 47, 0.9), transparent);
    }

    .moment {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: stretch;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.98);
      transition: opacity 700ms ease, transform 700ms ease;
    }

    .moment.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }

    .dot {
      position: relative;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-top: 26px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 25%, #fff4e6, var(--gold) 34%, var(--red) 72%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.6);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.08), 0 0 34px rgba(214, 15, 47, 0.45);
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .moment-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 280px;
      padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 36px);
      border-radius: 32px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.13), rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.045)),
        rgba(35, 3, 10, 0.68);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 224, 163, 0.26);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .moment-card::after {
      content: attr(data-number);
      position: absolute;
      right: 18px;
      top: 6px;
      font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 11rem);
      line-height: 1;
      color: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.055);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .moment-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .pill {
      padding: 8px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.26);
      color: var(--soft-gold);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .moment h2 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      max-width: 760px;
      font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
      line-height: 0.96;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .moment p {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.82);
      font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.6vw, 1.08rem);
      line-height: 1.82;
    }

    .visual {
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(14px, 4vw, 38px);
      bottom: clamp(14px, 4vw, 30px);
      width: clamp(84px, 15vw, 150px);
      height: clamp(84px, 15vw, 150px);
      opacity: 0.86;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .visual.record {
      border-radius: 50%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle, var(--wine) 0 12%, var(--gold) 13% 17%, var(--wine) 18% 40%, rgba(255,244,230,0.13) 41% 43%, var(--wine) 44% 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 44px rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.14);
      animation: spin 18s linear infinite;
    }

    .visual.flower {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--gold) 0 12%, transparent 13%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 10%, rgba(255,183,197,0.9) 0 22%, transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 50%, rgba(214,15,47,0.75) 0 22%, transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 90%, rgba(246,184,75,0.75) 0 22%, transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 50%, rgba(255,244,230,0.45) 0 22%, transparent 24%);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.20));
      animation: pulse 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .visual.wave {
      border-radius: 34% 66% 42% 58% / 42% 35% 65% 58%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,183,197,0.95), rgba(214,15,47,0.8), rgba(246,184,75,0.95));
      filter: blur(0.2px);
      animation: morph 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .visual.star {
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 60% 36%, 98% 35%, 68% 56%, 79% 94%, 50% 70%, 21% 94%, 32% 56%, 2% 35%, 40% 36%);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--red));
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.3);
      animation: pulse 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .visual.heart {
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red), var(--pink));
      width: clamp(70px, 13vw, 120px);
      height: clamp(70px, 13vw, 120px);
      right: clamp(22px, 5vw, 60px);
      bottom: clamp(20px, 5vw, 44px);
      animation: heartbeat 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .visual.heart::before,
    .visual.heart::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: inherit;
    }

    .visual.heart::before {
      top: -50%;
      left: 0;
    }

    .visual.heart::after {
      left: 50%;
      top: 0;
    }

    @keyframes spin {
      to {
        transform: rotate(360deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      50% {
        transform: scale(1.08) rotate(5deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes morph {
      50% {
        border-radius: 63% 37% 56% 44% / 52% 61% 39% 48%;
        transform: rotate(8deg) scale(1.05);
      }
    }

    @keyframes heartbeat {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: rotate(-45deg) scale(1);
      }
      45% {
        transform: rotate(-45deg) scale(1.08);
      }
    }

    .music {
      padding: 26px 0 82px;
    }

    .music-card {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 44px);
      border-radius: 34px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(246, 184, 75, 0.18), rgba(214, 15, 47, 0.12)),
        rgba(255, 244, 230, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 224, 163, 0.30);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .music h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 5.4rem);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    }

    .music p {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255,244,230,0.82);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .player-shell {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 170px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,244,230,0.22);
      background: rgba(42, 5, 12, 0.44);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .player-placeholder {
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(255,244,230,0.78);
    }

    .play-button {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--wine);
      background: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(246,184,75,0.24);
      transition: transform 220ms ease;
    }

    .play-button:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 352px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 0 0 34px;
      color: rgba(255,244,230,0.52);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .page {
        width: min(100% - 22px, 1120px);
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .hero-card {
        border-radius: 28px;
      }

      .golden-monkey {
        position: relative;
        right: auto;
        bottom: auto;
        margin: 30px 0 -8px auto;
      }

      .timeline::before {
        left: 14px;
      }

      .moment {
        grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr;
        gap: 13px;
      }

      .dot {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
      }

      .moment-card {
        min-height: 360px;
        border-radius: 26px;
      }

      .visual {
        opacity: 0.42;
      }

      .music-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        border-radius: 26px;
      }

      iframe {
        min-height: 300px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="noise"></div>

  <div class="floating-shapes" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="shape one"></div>
    <div class="shape two"></div>
    <div class="shape three"></div>
  </div>

  <main class="page">
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="spark"></span> Cronología no oficial</span>

        <h1>Por qué <span class="hero-title-accent">Zur</span> me gusta</h1>

        <p class="hero-copy">
          Una página hecha como si fuera una cápsula visual: roja, cálida, medio musical
          y con un mono dorado escondido como amuleto. La idea es contar, en cinco momentos,
          cómo algo que parecía pequeño se fue volviendo cada vez más bonito.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#timeline">Empezar la cronología</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="#cancion">Ir a la canción</a>
        </div>

        <div class="golden-monkey" aria-label="Ilustración decorativa de un mono dorado">
          <div class="monkey-face">
            <span class="ear left"></span>
            <span class="ear right"></span>
            <span class="eye left"></span>
            <span class="eye right"></span>
            <span class="nose"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline-wrap" id="timeline">
      <p class="section-label">Cinco momentos para explicar algo que no cabe en cinco momentos</p>
      <div class="timeline" id="timelineContent"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="music" id="cancion">
      <div class="music-card">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Una canción para cerrar</p>
          <h2>Y si esto tuviera soundtrack...</h2>
          <p>
            Aquí puedes poner una canción de Rusowsky, Jesse Baez, aquihayaquihay
            o cualquier otra que te recuerde a Zur. El reproductor se carga desde JavaScript,
            para que puedas cambiar el enlace sin tocar el diseño.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="player-shell" id="musicPlayer">
          <div class="player-placeholder">
            <button class="play-button" id="loadSong" aria-label="Cargar canción">▶</button>
            <strong>Reproducir canción</strong>
            <p>Haz clic para cargar el embed que definas en <code>script.js</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Hecho con rojo, mono dorado y una excusa muy bonita.
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
